
# Throwaway probe arms, re-minted on every run of e2e/probe-witness.mts.
# Committing them would commit a SPENT proof: a swap consumes what it is given,
# so these are single-use and a checked-in copy is worse than none.
witness-test.token
witness-test.json
control-unlocked.token
control-unlocked.json
witness-positive.token
witness-positive.json
revocation-probe.token
revocation-probe.json
